Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 22:30:58 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Leaf: Limit pushable entity queries

Original license: GPL-3.0-only
Original project: https://github.com/Winds-Studio/Leaf

Original patch by HaHaWTH <102713261+HaHaWTH@users.noreply.github.com>

Avoid collecting every nearby pushable entity before processing collisions, only keep the entities needed by the collision limit and stop iterating once both the collision limit and the cramming check are resolved. Cramming damage and the order entities are pushed in are unchanged.

Unlike the Leaf version, a nested call falls back to a fresh state object instead of throwing, since cramming damage and pushes can run plugin event handlers while the shared state is in use.

